[[2,3,4096,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The supply for the fan \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N11</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               arrives\ndirectly from the battery from the line for the VENT maxifuse of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B6</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              :\nthe fan therefore works when it receives an earth command.</p><p>The relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              has a coil supplied\ndirectly by the line controlled by the ignition (15/54) protected\nby fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B25</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>It is energized by an earth signal coming\nfrom the engine control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>If the engine coolant reaches a high temperature,\nthe control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends an earth signal (from pin 26)\nto the relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               which energizes the coil. The relay then\nsends an earth which operates the fan \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N11</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p>"]]